        8,
        13
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manderson%2C_Wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town of Manderson lies on the Nowood River near its confluence with the Bighorn River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/manderson_wyoming"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Manderson became the site of the first post office in Big Horn County during its early settlement years.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
